    "verseCount": 25,
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "chapter",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "number": "1",
          "style": "c",
          "sid": "JUD 1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "1",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "1",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Judha, muranda waJesu Kristu nomununʼuna waJakobho, kuna vaya vakadanwa, vanodikanwa naMwari Baba, vanochengetwa naJesu Kristu:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.1"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "b"
        },
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "2",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:2"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "2",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Ngoni, rugare norudo ngazviwande kwamuri.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.2"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "b"
        },
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Chivi noKuparadzwa kwaVanhu Vasina Mwari",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "3",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:3"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "3",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Shamwari dzinodikanwa, kunyange ndakanga ndichishingairira kuti ndinyore kwamuri pamusoro poruponeso rwatinogovana, ndakafunga kuti ndinofanira kunyora ndichikukurudzirai kuti murwire kutenda kwakapiwa vatsvene kamwe.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "4",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:4"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "4",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Nokuti vamwe varume vane kutongwa kwavo kwakanyorwa nezvako kare, vakapinda muchivande pakati penyu. Ivo vanhu vasina umwari, vanoshandura nyasha dzaMwari wedu vachidzitora semvumo yokuita upombwe, uye vachiramba Jesu Kristu, Ishe naTenzi wedu mumwe oga.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.4"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "5",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:5"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "5",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Kunyange maizviziva henyu kare, ndinoda kukuyeuchidzai kuti Ishe akasunungura vanhu vake kubva muIjipiti, asi pashure akaparadza vaya vakanga vasingatendi.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.5"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "6",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:6"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "6",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Uye vatumwa vasina kuchengeta nzvimbo youkuru hwavo asi vakasiya musha wavo, ivava akavachengeta murima, vakasungwa nengetani dzokusingaperi vakamirira kutongwa pazuva guru.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "7",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:7"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "7",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Nenzira imwe cheteyo, Sodhomu neGomora uye namaguta akanga akapoteredza akazvipa kuupombwe nokutsauka, akava muenzaniso wavaya vari pakurangwa nomoto usingaperi.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.7"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "8",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:8"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "8",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Nenzira imwe cheteyo, ava varoti vanosvibisa miviri yavo, vachiramba vakuru uye vachituka zvisikwa zvokudenga.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "9",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:9"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "9",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Asi kunyange Mikaeri mutumwa mukuru, paakanga achirwa nadhiabhori pamusoro pomuviri waMozisi, haana kutsunga kutaura mashoko okutuka nokumupomera mhosva, asi akati, \"Ishe ngaakutuke!\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "10",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:10"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "10",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Asi vanhu ava vanotaura zvisina maturo pamusoro pezvinhu zvavasinganzwisisi; uye kunyange nezvinhu zvavanonzwisisa kubva pakuberekwa kwavo, semhuka dzisingafungi, zvinhu izvozvi ndizvo chaizvo zvinovaparadza.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.10"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "11",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:11"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "11",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Vane nhamo! Vakasarudza nzira yaKaini; vakamhanyira mubayiro wokutsauka kwaBharamu; vakaparadzwa mukupanduka kwaKora.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.11"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "12",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:12"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "12",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Vanhu ava makwapa pamitambo yenyu yorudo, vanodya nemi vasingatyi napaduku, vanongozvipa zvokudya ivo chete. Makore asina mvura, anotinhwa nemhepo; miti yenguva yamasutso, isina michero uye yakadzurwa, yakafa zvakapetwa kaviri.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.12"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "13",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:13"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "13",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Mafungu egungwa anopenga, anopupuma nyadzi dzawo; nyeredzi dzinodzungaira, ivava vakachengeterwa rima guru nokusingaperi.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.13"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "14",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:14"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "14",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Enoki, wechinomwe kubva kuna Adhamu, akaprofita pamusoro pavanhu ava achiti, \"Tarirai, Ishe ari kuuya nezviuru nezviuru zvavatsvene vake",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.14"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "15",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:15"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "15",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "kuti azotonga vanhu vose, uye abate nemhosva vose vasina umwari pamusoro pamabasa ose asina umwari avakaita nenzira isina umwari, uye namashoko okutuka akataurwa navanhu vasina umwari pamusoro pake.\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "16",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:16"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "16",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Vanhu ava vanyunyuti uye vapomeri; vanotevera kuchiva kwavo vamene; vanozvirumbidza pachavo uye vanobata vamwe kumeso kuti zvivanakire ivo.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.16",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.16"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Kutsungirira",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "17",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:17"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "17",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Asi, vadikani, rangarirai zvakataurwa navapostori vaIshe wedu Jesu Kristu.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.17",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.17"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "18",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:18"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "18",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Vakati kwamuri, \"Munguva yokupedzisira kuchava navaseki vachatevera kuchiva kwavo.\"",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.18",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.18"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "19",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:19"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "19",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Ava ndivo vanhu vanokuparadzanisai, vanotevera nyama yavo uye vasina Mweya.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.19",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.19"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "20",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:20"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "20",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Asi imi, vadikani, zvivakei mukutenda kwenyu kutsvene uye munyengetere muMweya Mutsvene.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.20",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.20"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "21",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:21"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "21",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Zvichengetei murudo rwaMwari pamunenge muchimirira ngoni dzaIshe wedu Jesu Kristu kuti dzikuuyisei kuupenyu husingaperi.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.21",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.21"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "22",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:22"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "22",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Itirai ngoni avo vanokahadzika;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.22",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.22"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "23",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:23"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "23",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "bvutai vamwe kubva mumoto mugovaponesa; vamwe muvanzwire ngoni dzakasanganiswa nokutya, muchivenga kunyange nenguo dzakasvibiswa nenyama.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.23",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.23"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "b"
        },
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Mashoko Okurumbidza",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "24",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:24"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "24",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Kuna iye anogona kukuchengetai kuti murege kugumburwa uye anokuisai pamberi pokubwinya kwake musina chamunopomerwa, uye nomufaro mukuru,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.24",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.24"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "25",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "JUD 1:25"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "25",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "kuna iye Mwari oga muponesi wedu, ngakuve nokubwinya, umambo, simba noukuru, nokuna Jesu Kristu Ishe wedu, nguva isati yavapo, zvino nokusingaperi! Ameni.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "JUD.1.25",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "JUD.1.25"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
